{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 52807, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 41063, "uid": 57172, "type": 4, "title": "关于WB的队伍扫盲", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1599138924, "updated_at": 1621997411, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1621997411, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 1, "status": 1, "summary": "各位大佬萌新好,最近韩服开WB了,本人来写一篇WB队伍构成。方便萌新组自己的队伍~Ps：（攻略的队伍如果差些什么，就自己酌情来组）1.WB是20个天子组成的队伍2.组成大的方向是：3把刀（百分比最佳，", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 14, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 18793, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 3, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 52807, "content": "<div>各位大佬萌新好,最近韩服开WB了,本人来写一篇WB队伍构成。方便萌新组自己的队伍~Ps：（攻略的队伍如果差些什么，就自己酌情来组）&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <br></div><div>1.WB是20个天子组成的队伍</div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br></div><div>2.组成大的方向是：3把刀（百分比最佳，没有六连刀其次），buff（双刃，弱点，应援等），debuff（破防，减速等），各系加速，刷新,奶（一般是复活奶，奶全体） （如果想详细了解BUFF可移步首页BUFF篇）（基本木系的是WB必上）</div><div>Ps：现在队长BUFF一般都是当期对策（没有就木南瓜）另外&nbsp; 小队BUFF都是统一刀CD-2S&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <br></div><div>3.特别注意各系对应的辅助DS攻击姿态（注意木人鱼是WB必上延长DEBUFF），(感谢仁太指出）如果你觉得你前排上奶还扛不住，可以上盾（&nbsp;比如美国队长,全体加防）&nbsp; &nbsp;最后记住：活着就是输出，如果练度不够，或者没有攻略里的角色，某些4X和3X也可以替代的。<span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">还有一定不要开3倍！最好开1倍或者2倍~三倍会掉伤害！ ！&nbsp; &nbsp;！！</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; <br></div><div> 4.本人第一次写攻略，有什么不足欢迎指出，WIKI欢迎各位的加入~！B站（在月色下如梦初醒）有本人的这次火WB阵容分享&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br></div><div> 悦色&nbsp; WIki攻略组</div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list